    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div><br>On Thursday, June 2, 2016 at 4:00:49 PM UTC+2, Joe Cheng [RStudio] wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">Hi Adrian,<br><br>You can use CSS to give you pre behavior except with line wrapping:<br><br>tags$div(style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;, txt)<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Thu, Jun 2, 2016 at 2:18 AM Adrian Waddell &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">adrian....@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hello All,<div><br></div><div>I am working on a commenting system with shiny where a user can enter a comment which I then wish to eventually display within a uiOutput block. Does anyone have any suggestions how this is best done so that the formatting in the output is as entered in the textarea?</div><div><br></div><div>Here is a minimal working example with my current issues described below (note I need the tagList() call as I add some more meta-data)</div><div><br></div><div>ui.R:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"color:#000\">shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> sidebarLayout</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><