.R:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"color:#000\">shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> output$my_output </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"color:#000\">   txt </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$my_textarea</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"color:#000\">   tagList</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"color:#000\">     tags$p</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;The comment is:&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"color:#000\">     shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span s